  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for the expansion of sustainable power supply and reduction of carbon emissions through deployment of run-of-river small hydropower in Osh region, Kyrgyz Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Due to insufficient power infrastructure, rural areas suffer from low energy access, and repeated power outages limit the provision of public services such as healthcare and education.In addition, the absence of distributed power generation technology utilizing existing canal infrastructure leads to inefficient use of water resources.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve energy access in rural areas of Osh region and contribute to climate change mitigation through demonstration of a run-of-river small hydropower system&#xc720;&#xc218;&#xc2dd; &#xc18c;&#xc218;&#xb825; &#xbc1c;&#xc804;&#xc758; &#xd604;&#xc9c0; &#xd655;&#xc0b0;&#xacfc; &#xc9c0;&#xc18d; &#xac00;&#xb2a5;&#xd55c; &#xd310;&#xb9e4;&amp;amp;amp;amp;middot;&#xacf5;&#xae09;&#xb9dd; &#xd655;&#xbcf4;,  &#xc720;&#xc218;&#xc2dd; &#xc18c;&#xc218;&#xb825; &#xbc1c;&#xc804;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xd0c4;&#xc18c;&#xbc30;&#xcd9c; &#xc800;&#xac10; &#xbc0f; &#xd604;&#xc9c0;&#xc8fc;&#xbbfc;  &#xc0b6;&#xc758; &#xc9c8; &#xac1c;&#xc120;</narrative>
